@startuml
title 1024-bit Value & Register Memory Model

component "1024-bit Register" as R
component "Register File" as RF
component "Vector Register File" as VRF

R .. RF : regfile[k] holds 16x64 limbs
R .. VRF : vregfile[v][i] holds i-th limb

R : limb[0..15] each is u64

note bottom
Current model:
- Values stored explicitly as 16 qwords (limbs)
- No shared RAM yet beyond memory[]
end note
@enduml

